---
title: "Cadence — Passage Mastery Algorithm"
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: "16px"
    primaryColor: "#eef2ff"
    primaryBorderColor: "#4f46e5"
    primaryTextColor: "#1e1b4b"
    lineColor: "#475569"
---
flowchart TD
    A["Pick a target<br/>(a scale, or a chunk of the piece)"] --> B["Set tempo = target speed<br/>metronome on"]
    B --> C["Student plays the target"]
    C --> D{"Played it correctly?<br/><i>low-confidence mic reads are<br/>ignored, never counted wrong</i>"}

    D -- "No" --> E["Reset the<br/>'correct in a row' count to 0"]
    E --> F{"Why is it failing?"}
    F -- "One specific spot" --> G["ISOLATE that fragment<br/>run this same loop on it,<br/>then put it back in context"]
    F -- "Generally too hard" --> H["SLOW DOWN<br/>halve the tempo"]
    F -- "Still stuck after<br/>slowing &amp; isolating" --> I["BACKWARDS CHAIN<br/>rebuild from the last note,<br/>adding one note at a time"]
    G --> C
    H --> C
    I --> C

    D -- "Yes" --> J["+1 to the<br/>'correct in a row' count"]
    J --> K{"Hit the threshold?<br/>3 / 5 / 7 in a row<br/>(by student level)"}
    K -- "Not yet" --> C
    K -- "Yes" --> L{"At target tempo?"}
    L -- "No" --> M["TEMPO LADDER<br/>raise tempo one step"]
    M --> C
    L -- "Yes" --> N(["DONE — target mastered"])

    classDef done fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d;
    classDef tool fill:#fef9c3,stroke:#ca8a04,color:#713f12;
    class N done;
    class G,H,I,M tool;
